3. Dataset-derived split manifests and third-party material

The original malaria image dataset is NOT redistributed in this repository.

Files under `data_splits/` contain derived split manifests and may include
filenames, labels, or identifiers originating from the source dataset.
These files do not transfer ownership or licensing rights over the original
dataset and remain subject, where applicable, to the terms and conditions of
the original data source.

Third-party software, datasets, pretrained weights, publications, and other
materials referenced by this repository retain their respective original
licenses, terms, and copyrights.

4. No relicensing of third-party material

Nothing in this repository should be interpreted as relicensing the original
malaria image dataset, pretrained model weights, or any other third-party
material.

For questions concerning reuse, please consult the original data/software
providers and the relevant license notices.
